Package: devjam-conky-system-monitor
Version: 1.17-2
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: x11-xserver-utils
Recommends: conky-std | conky-all, devjam-cpu-powercap, jq
Suggests: libkscreen-bin
Maintainer: Bob Rosbag <debian@bobrosbag.nl>
Description: Conky system monitor theme
 Conky configuration with Lua helper functions that scales with the
 display, plus a display watcher that restarts Conky when the
 resolution, refresh rate or scaling factor changes (KScreen or xrandr).
 The files are installed in /usr/share/devjam/conky.
